Synthetic test media

All files in this directory were generated for this public source release by
scripts/generate-test-video-fixtures.mjs using FFmpeg lavfi colour and sine
sources. They contain no game artwork, soundtrack, recordings or downloaded
third-party media. The JPEG is a single solid-colour image. The audio rejection
fixture adds a generated 440 Hz sine tone.

browser-avc-prefix.mp4 retains the historical test filename for compatibility.
Its content is newly generated synthetic AVC video with synthetic type-14 SVC
prefix NAL units inserted using Mediabunny. It is not a browser recording.

The generator and these original synthetic fixtures are distributed under this
repository's GPL-3.0 licence. Regeneration requires FFmpeg with libx264 and the
locked npm dependencies. Run from the repository root:

  node scripts/generate-test-video-fixtures.mjs